    "text": "8 days ago The Cincinnati Bengals made waves on Monday by releasing backup quarterback Mike White from their practice squad, a move that has sparked intense speculation about the team’s plans at the position. With franchise star Joe Burrow sidelined indefinitely due to a toe injury and current starter Jake Browning failing to inspire confidence, fans on X asked the organization to pursue for a replacement in the form of Jameis Winston. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
